    "notes": "All three endpoints the frontend listed are implemented; GET .../negotiation returns 404 when no routing row exists, as required. Enum values emitted: routingType 'Sequential'|'Parallel'; negotiationStatus 'With Internal'|'With Counterparty'|'Agreed'; VersionSummaryResponse.source 'Internal'|'External'; reminderType is 'Manual' for this endpoint ('Auto' is only written by the background sweep in app/services/scheduled_notifications.py, which exposes no HTTP route). reviewStatus is only ever 'Pending' or 'Submitted' — the backend never writes 'Overdue'; lateness is conveyed by NegotiationTrackerResponse.overdueFlag, so the UI must derive an Overdue label from overdueFlag + reviewStatus 'Pending'. POST .../routing is restricted to CONTRACT_OWNER and POST .../mark-agreed to LEGAL_REVIEWER — other roles get 403. internalReviewers is an array of UUID strings in RoutingRequest but an array of ReviewerResponse objects in every response."
